"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"

msgid "Every day, the work email addresses of active users are sent to the chosen provider to find known data breaches; each exposure is recorded in a sensitive register and the CISO group is notified. Personal addresses are never sent. A verified domain needs a single request; otherwise addresses are checked one by one, within the rate limit of the provider."
msgstr "Every day, the work email addresses of active users are sent to the chosen provider to find known data breaches; each exposure is recorded in a sensitive register and the CISO group is notified. Personal addresses are never sent. A verified domain needs a single request; otherwise addresses are checked one by one, within the rate limit of the provider."

msgid "Breach data provider"
msgstr "Breach data provider"

msgid "Free, no key needed"
msgstr "Free, no key needed"

msgid "Paid API key"
msgstr "Paid API key"

msgid "Free API: up to %d addresses per run (the provider allows 25 per hour and 100 per day); the next run resumes where the previous one stopped. To go faster, run the \"breachmonitor\" automatic action every hour."
msgstr "Free API: up to %d addresses per run (the provider allows 25 per hour and 100 per day); the next run resumes where the previous one stopped. To go faster, run the \"breachmonitor\" automatic action every hour."

msgid "API documentation"
msgstr "API documentation"

msgid "XposedOrNot domain API key (optional)"
msgstr "XposedOrNot domain API key (optional)"

msgid "Free key given once your domain is verified on the XposedOrNot dashboard: the whole domain is then checked with a single request. Encrypted with the GLPI key and never displayed again."
msgstr "Free key given once your domain is verified on the XposedOrNot dashboard: the whole domain is then checked with a single request. Encrypted with the GLPI key and never displayed again."

msgid "%s: connection successful."
msgstr "%s: connection successful."

msgid "%s refused the API key."
msgstr "%s refused the API key."

msgid "%1$s could not be reached (code %2$d)."
msgstr "%1$s could not be reached (code %2$d)."

msgid "Published by the breach database"
msgstr "Published by the breach database"

msgid "Data breach monitoring: checks work email addresses with the chosen provider (XposedOrNot or Have I Been Pwned)"
msgstr "Data breach monitoring: checks work email addresses with the chosen provider (XposedOrNot or Have I Been Pwned)"

msgid "%1$s: error %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s: error %2$s"

msgid "%s: rate limit reached, the next run resumes where this one stopped"
msgstr "%s: rate limit reached, the next run resumes where this one stopped"

msgid "Work email addresses found in known data breaches, checked every day with the provider chosen in the plugin configuration (XposedOrNot or Have I Been Pwned), to which these addresses are sent."
msgstr "Work email addresses found in known data breaches, checked every day with the provider chosen in the plugin configuration (XposedOrNot or Have I Been Pwned), to which these addresses are sent."
